on notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-mat-icon-type=\"font\" data-mat-icon-name=\"content_copy\"></mat-icon><!----><span class=\"mat-focus-indicator\"></span><span class=\"mat-mdc-button-touch-target\"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c3678280791-690\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c3678280791-690\"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3678280791-690\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c3678280791-690\">docker system prune -f\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><p data-path-to-node=\"21\">Perintah ini aman karena hanya menghapus container yang sudah mati, cache build, dan image tak bernama (). Container yang sedang berjalan atau aktif tidak akan terganggu.</p><hr data-path-to-node=\"22\"><h2 data-path-to-node=\"23\">Tahap 5: Verifikasi Akhir</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"24\">Setelah semua langkah di atas selesai, lakukan pengecekan akhir untuk memastikan storage sudah kembali lega:</p><div _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c3678280791-691 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1e6aaee7f05c90c2&quot;,&quot;c_5565fea761e1b769&quot;,null,&quot;rc_aa9212d69f708301&quot;,null,null,&quot;id&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwje19Pct4WVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQtQk\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c3678280791-691 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3678280791-691\">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c3678280791-691 ng-star-inserted\"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" aria-label=\"Download code\" mat-icon-button=\"\" gemtooltip=\"Download code\" class=\"mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c3678280791-691 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted\" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized=\"\" mat-ripple-loader-class-name=\"mat-mdc-button-ripple\" mat-ripple-loader-centered=\"\"><span class=\"mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple\"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" role=\"img\" fonticon=\"download\" class=\"mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-mat-icon-type=\"font\" data-mat-icon-name=\"download\"></mat-icon><!----><span class=\"mat-focus-indicator\"></span><span class=\"mat-mdc-button-touch-target\"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" aria-label=\"Copy code\" mat-icon-button=\"\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" class=\"mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c3678280791-691 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted\" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized=\"\" mat-ripple-loader-class-name=\"mat-mdc-button-ripple\" mat-ripple-loader-centered=\"\" jslog=\"179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1e6aaee7f05c90c2&quot;,&quot;c_5565fea761e1b769&quot;,null,&quot;rc_aa9212d69f708301&quot;,null,null,&quot;id&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true\"><span class=\"mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple\"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" role=\"img\" fonticon=\"content_copy\" class=\"mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-mat-icon-type=\"font\" data-mat-icon-name=\"content_copy\"></mat-icon><!----><span class=\"mat-focus-indicator\"></span><span class=\"mat-mdc-button-touch-target\"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c3678280791-691\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c3678280791-691\"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3678280791-691\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c3678280791=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c3678280791-691\">df -h\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><h3 data-path-to-node=\"26\">Tips Tambahan:</h3><p><response-element class=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3678280791-690 ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><response-element class=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c3678280791=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3678280791-691 ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"27\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"27,0,0\">Lakukan pengecekan rutin ini setidaknya 3 atau 6 bulan sekali.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"27,1,0\">Pembersihan dengan metode truncate (&gt;) di atas sama sekali tidak mempengaruhi konfigurasi pengguna VPN, password, maupun performa jaringan utama.</p></li></ul>');
INSERT INTO `tb_troubleshoot` (`id`, `tanggal`, `kategori`, `judul_kendala`, `detail_error`, `cara_solusi`) VALUES
(42, '2026-06-17 00:06:28', 'Server', 'cara menginstal samba di server ubuntu dan membuat folder sharing', 'cara menginstal samba di server ubuntu dan membuat folder sharing', '<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><b>Langkah 1:\r\nInstalasi Samba Server di Ubuntu</b><o:p></o:p></span></p></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Sebelum\r\nmengonfigurasi apa pun, kita harus memperbarui repositori sistem dan menginstal\r\npaket Samba. Buka terminal Ubuntu kamu dan jalankan perintah berikut:</span></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># 1. Update list\r\npaket sistem<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo apt update</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># 2. Instal Samba\r\nServer<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo apt install\r\nsamba samba-common-bin -y</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># 3. Pastikan\r\nlayanan Samba langsung berjalan dan aktif setiap server dinyalakan<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo systemctl\r\nstart smbd<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo systemctl\r\nenable smbd<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Untuk memastikan\r\nSamba sudah terinstal dengan benar, cek statusnya:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo systemctl\r\nstatus smbd<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">(Pastikan muncul\r\ntulisan berawarna hijau: active (running)).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><b>Langkah 2:\r\nMenyiapkan Folder di Linux (Ubuntu)</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Samba tidak akan\r\nbekerja dengan baik jika folder di sistem Linux aslinya belum diberi izin\r\n(permission) yang tepat. Kita akan membuat dua contoh folder di direktori\r\n/srv/:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">angga-publik\r\n(Tanpa Password)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">share-privat\r\n(Wajib Password)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Jalankan perintah\r\nini di terminal:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># Membuat folder<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo mkdir -p\r\n/srv/angga-publik<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo mkdir -p\r\n/srv/share-privat<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># Mengatur izin\r\nfolder PUBLIK agar semua orang (bahkan anonim) bisa baca &amp; tulis<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo chown -R\r\nnobody:nogroup /srv/angga-publik<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo chmod -R 777\r\n/srv/angga-publik<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># Mengatur izin\r\nfolder PRIVAT (hanya pemilik dan kelompoknya yang punya akses penuh)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo chmod -R 775\r\n/srv/share-privat</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><b>Langkah 3:\r\nMembuat User Samba (Untuk Mode Password)</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Samba menggunakan\r\ndatabase user-nya sendiri. Jika kamu ingin folder memakai password, kamu harus\r\nmendaftarkan user Linux ke dalam Samba.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Misalkan kita\r\ningin membuat user bernama admin:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Bash</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># 1. Daftarkan\r\nuser ke sistem Ubuntu (jika user \'admin\' belum ada)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo adduser\r\nadmin --shell /usr/sbin/nologin --no-create-home<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># 2. Daftarkan\r\nuser tersebut ke database Samba dan buat password-nya<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo smbpasswd -a\r\nadmin<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Sistem akan\r\nmeminta kamu mengetikkan password baru sebanyak 2 kali. Ingat baik-baik\r\npassword ini.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><b>Langkah 4:\r\nKonfigurasi File smb.conf</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Sekarang kita\r\nakan menyunting file konfigurasi utama Samba. Sebelum diubah, biasakan untuk\r\nmem-backup file aslinya:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo cp\r\n/etc/samba/smb.conf /etc/samba/smb.conf.bak<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo nano\r\n/etc/samba/smb.conf<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Hapus semua\r\nisinya (atau langsung geser ke paling bawah file) dan masukkan konfigurasi\r\nberikut:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ini, TOML<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">[global]<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; workgroup = WORKGROUP<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; server string = Samba Server Angga<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; security = user<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; # Baris di bawah ini WAJIB ada agar folder\r\ntanpa password (guest) bisa diakses<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; map to guest = Bad User<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; server min protocol = SMB2<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; server max protocol = SMB3<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">#\r\n==========================================<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># 1. FOLDER TANPA\r\nPASSWORD (PUBLIK)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">#\r\n==========================================<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">[angga-fs]<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; comment = Folder Publik Bebas Akses<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; path = /srv/angga-publik<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; browseable = yes<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; writable = yes<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; guest ok = yes<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; read only = no<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; force user = nobody<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; create mask = 0777<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; directory mask = 0777<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">#\r\n==========================================<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># 2. FOLDER WAJIB\r\nPASSWORD (PRIVAT)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">#\r\n==========================================<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">[share-data]<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; comment = Folder Privat Khusus Admin<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; path = /srv/share-privat<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; browseable = yes<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; writable = yes<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; guest ok = no<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; read only = no<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; valid users = admin<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; create mask = 0664<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; directory mask = 0775<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Keterangan &amp;\r\nAction Script di Atas:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">map to guest =\r\nBad User (Di bagian [global]): Mengizinkan user yang tidak terdaftar otomatis\r\nmasuk sebagai tamu (guest). Jika ini tidak ada, folder tanpa password akan\r\ntetap meminta login.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">path: Jalur\r\nfolder asli di dalam server Ubuntu kamu.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">browseable = yes:\r\nMembuat folder ini terlihat saat client mengetikkan IP server (\\\\172.16.70.12).</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">guest ok = yes:\r\nAction Tanpa Password. Mengizinkan orang masuk anonim.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">guest ok = no:\r\nAction Wajib Password. Menutup akses bagi pengguna anonim.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">valid users =\r\nadmin: Membatasi folder hanya boleh dimasuki oleh user admin yang sudah dibuat\r\ndi Langkah 3.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">force user =\r\nnobody: Memaksa semua file yang dibuat di folder publik menjadi milik user\r\nnobody agar tidak terjadi error lock antar pengguna.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">create mask &amp;\r\ndirectory mask: Mengatur hak akses file/folder baru yang dibuat oleh client\r\ndari Windows.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Setelah selesai\r\nmengetik, simpan di Nano dengan menekan Ctrl + O, lalu Enter, dan keluar dengan\r\nCtrl + X.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><b>Langkah 5:\r\nPengujian Konfigurasi dan Restart</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Setiap kali kamu\r\nmengubah file smb.conf, kamu wajib memeriksa apakah ada salah ketik menggunakan\r\nperintah bawaan Samba:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">testparm<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Jika tidak ada\r\npesan error/syntax error, jalankan restart service agar konfigurasi diterapkan:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo systemctl\r\nrestart smbd<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo systemctl\r\nrestart nmbd<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><b>Cara Jika Ingin\r\nMenambahkan Folder Baru di Kemudian Hari<o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><b>Jika di masa\r\ndepan kamu ingin menambah folder sharing baru (misal namanya: [data-desain]),\r\nkamu tidak perlu menginstal ulang. Cukup lakukan 3 langkah cepat ini:</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">1. Buat foldernya\r\ndi Linux dan atur izinnya<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo mkdir -p\r\n/srv/data-desain</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># Opsi A: Jika\r\ningin folder baru ini TANPA PASSWORD<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo chown -R\r\nnobody:nogroup /srv/data-desain<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo chmod -R 777\r\n/srv/data-desain</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"># Opsi B: Jika\r\ningin folder baru ini PAKE PASSWORD (misal untuk user admin)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo chmod -R\r\n0775 /srv/data-desain<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">2. Buka smb.conf\r\ndan tambahkan script di paling bawah<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo nano\r\n/etc/samba/smb.conf<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Tambahkan balok\r\nkode baru di bagian paling bawah file:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ini, TOML<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">[data-desain]<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; comment = Folder Desain<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; path = /srv/data-desain<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; browseable = yes<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; writable = yes<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; read only = no<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; # GANTI DI SINI SESUAI KEBUTUHAN:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; guest ok = yes&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; # Ubah ke \'no\' jika ingin pakai password<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;&nbsp; # valid users = admin # Hilangkan tanda\r\npagar (#) di depan jika guest ok = no<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Simpan dan keluar\r\n(Ctrl+O -&gt; Enter -&gt; Ctrl+X).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">3. Validasi dan\r\nRestart Samba<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Bash<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">testparm<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">sudo systemctl\r\nrestart smbd<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Folder baru\r\nlangsung otomatis terdeteksi di Windows client tanpa mengganggu folder yang\r\nlama!</span></p><p></p><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c1376676189-207 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[\" r_97b97a879d0de072\",\"c_ef8cff5397a2a8ee\",null,\"rc_d07c54ef57705768\",null,null,\"id\",null,1,null,null,1,0]]\"=\"\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwi20dD19oyVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ_wI\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1376676189-207\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c1376676189-207\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c1376676189-207 ng-star-inserted\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c1376676189-207 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"arrow_circle_down\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Download code\" gemtooltip=\"Download code\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1376676189-207 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c1220514461=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-41\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"copy\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Copy code\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" data-test-id=\"gem-copy-button\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1376676189-207 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c1220514461=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-42\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----></gem-icon-button></div></div></div></div></div>');
INSERT INTO `tb_troubleshoot` (`id`, `tanggal`, `kategori`, `judul_kendala`, `detail_error`, `cara_solusi`) VALUES
(43, '2026-06-17 01:52:52', 'Aplikasi', 'syncron jam di pc', 'syncron jam di pc', '<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\">Langkah 1: Buka CMD dengan Hak Akses Administrator</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Perintah pengaturan waktu sistem membutuhkan izin penuh (Administrator) agar bisa berjalan.</p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\">Tekan tombol <b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"13\">Windows</b> di keyboard Anda (atau klik kolom pencarian di Taskbar).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\">Ketik <b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"6\"><code data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"6\">cmd</code></b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\">Di bagian kanan menu pencarian, klik <b data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Run as administrator</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0\">Jika muncul jendela konfirmasi <i data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">User Account Control (UAC)</i>, klik <b data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">Yes</b>.</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Langkah 2: Ubah Zona Waktu ke Jakarta (WIB)</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Windows menggunakan nama khusus untuk mendefinisikan zona waktu Jakarta/WIB, yaitu <i data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"83\">\"SE Asia Standard Time\"</i>.</p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"9\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\">Di dalam jendela CMD yang hitam, ketik atau salin perintah berikut:</p><response-element class=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1376676189-172 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c1376676189-172 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_fd95416040b36aba&quot;,&quot;c_3935a8